    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that’s not enough. closing my eyes or breathing doesn't actually make the world stop. it’s still there, pounding in my head, even when i’m alone. i don’t want a temporary break or a little bit of calm. i want real, absolute silence. i want it to be so quiet that nothing can reach me ever again. i just want the noise to stop for good.",
